### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiPrefix = /api/v1/students
@contentType = application/json

### ========== Health & Root ==========

### 1. Root - Hello World
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### ========== CREATE (POST) ==========

### 3. Create Student - Success
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "habib",
  "email": "habib@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Create Student - Validation Error (username empty)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Create Student - Validation Error (invalid email)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "budi",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 6. Create Student - Validation Error (password too short)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "andi",
  "email": "andi@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 7. Create Student - Duplicate Username
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "habib",
  "email": "duplicate@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 8. Create Student - Wrong Content-Type
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}
Content-Type: text/plain

{
  "username": "test",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ========== READ (GET) ==========

### 9. List All Students
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/

### 10. List Students with Pagination (page=1, limit=5)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/?page=1&limit=5

### 11. List Students with Search
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/?search=habib

### 12. List Students Filtered by is_active=true
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/?is_active=true

### 13. List Students Filtered by is_active=false
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/?is_active=false

### 14. List Students Sorted by username DESC
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/?sort=username&order=desc

### 15. List Students Sorted by email ASC
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/?sort=email&order=asc

### 16. List Students with Invalid Sort (defaults to id)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/?sort=invalid_field

### 17. Get Student by ID - Success
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1

### 18. Get Student by ID - Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/999

### 19. Get Student by ID - Invalid ID
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/abc

### ========== UPDATE (PUT) ==========

### 20. Replace Student - Success
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "habib_updated",
  "email": "habib_new@example.com",
  "is_active": true
}

### 21. Replace Student - Validation Error (username empty)
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "is_active": true
}

### 22. Replace Student - Validation Error (invalid email)
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "no-at-sign",
  "is_active": true
}

### 23. Replace Student - Not Found
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "ghost",
  "email": "ghost@example.com",
  "is_active": false
}

### ========== UPDATE (PATCH) ==========

### 24. Patch Student - Update Username Only
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "habib_patched"
}

### 25. Patch Student - Update Email Only
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "patched@example.com"
}

### 26. Patch Student - Deactivate
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "is_active": false
}

### 27. Patch Student - Multiple Fields
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "multi_field",
  "email": "multi@example.com",
  "is_active": true
}

### 28. Patch Student - Empty Body (no fields)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### 29. Patch Student - Not Found
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "ghost"
}

### ========== DELETE ==========

### 30. Delete Student - Success
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1

### 31. Delete Student - Not Found
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/999

### 32. Delete Student - Invalid ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/abc

### ========== 404 Fallback ==========

### 33. Undefined Endpoint - 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/unknown

### 34. Random Path - 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/random/path/here


### ========== RBAC & ROLE MATRIX ==========
### Skenario: siapkan 3 akun (admin / staff / user) dengan /auth/register,
### naikkan role admin & staff lewat SQL, lalu login untuk mendapatkan
### token. Ganti variabel di bawah secara manual setelah login berhasil.

### ---- Setup: daftarkan tiga akun ----
### Register Admin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "email": "admin@unair.ac.id",
  "password": "Rahasia123!"
}

### Register Staff
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "staff",
  "email": "staff@unair.ac.id",
  "password": "Rahasia123!"
}

### Register User Biasa
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "userbiasa",
  "email": "user@unair.ac.id",
  "password": "Rahasia123!"
}

### ---- Login & simpan token ----
### Login Admin -> simpan di {{tokenAdmin}}
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Rahasia123!"
}

### Login Staff -> simpan di {{tokenStaff}}
# @name loginStaff
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "staff",
  "password": "Rahasia123!"
}

### Login User Biasa -> simpan di {{tokenUser}}
# @name loginUser
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "userbiasa",
  "password": "Rahasia123!"
}

@tokenAdmin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
@tokenStaff = {{loginStaff.response.body.access_token}}
@tokenUser  = {{loginUser.response.body.access_token}}

### ---- GET /students (list) ----
### Expected: admin 200, staff 200, user 403
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenStaff}}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### ---- GET /students/:id -- diri sendiri ----
### Expected: 200 untuk semua role (self-access)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenStaff}}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/3
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### ---- GET /students/:id -- milik orang lain ----
### Expected: admin 200, staff 200, user 403 (user hanya boleh akses diri sendiri)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/3
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenStaff}}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### ---- PUT /students/:id -- milik orang lain ----
### Expected: admin 200, staff 403, user 403
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

{
  "username": "staff_updated",
  "email": "staff_new@unair.ac.id",
  "is_active": true
}

###
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenStaff}}

{
  "username": "admin_updated",
  "email": "admin_new@unair.ac.id",
  "is_active": true
}

###
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

{
  "username": "user_updated",
  "email": "user_new@unair.ac.id",
  "is_active": true
}

### ---- DELETE /students/:id -- orang lain ----
### Expected: admin 204, staff 403, user 403
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenStaff}}

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### ---- DELETE /students/:id -- diri sendiri ----
### Expected: admin 403, staff 403, user 403 (tidak boleh hapus akun sendiri)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenStaff}}

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/3
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### ---- PATCH /students/:id/role -- milik orang lain ----
### Expected: admin 200, staff 403, user 403
### Admin menaikkan user id=3 dari user menjadi staff
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/3/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

{
  "role": "staff"
}

###
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenStaff}}

{
  "role": "admin"
}

###
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

{
  "role": "admin"
}

### ---- PATCH /students/:id/role -- diri sendiri ----
### Expected: 422 Unprocessable Entity (admin mengubah role dirinya sendiri)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

{
  "role": "staff"
}

###
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/2/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenStaff}}

{
  "role": "admin"
}

###
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/3/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

{
  "role": "admin"
}

### ---- Tanpa Authorization header ----
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized untuk semua role
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/

###
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "x",
  "email": "x@example.com",
  "is_active": true
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1

###
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/1/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "staff"
}

### ---- Pengujian hampir selalu terlupa: token lama setelah role berubah ----
### Skenario: admin menaikkan user id=3 dari user ke staff (sudah dilakukan
### di atas dengan PATCH /students/3/role). Sekarang panggil endpoint
### dengan token LAMA milik user id=3 (yang masih membawa role "user").
### Expected: 403 karena role di token tidak sinkron lagi.
# @name loginUserLama
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "userbiasa",
  "password": "Rahasia123!"
}

@tokenUserLama = {{loginUserLama.response.body.access_token}}

###
### Token lama masih role "user" -- 403 ("role user tidak memiliki hak user:list")
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserLama}}

###
### Login ulang akan menghasilkan token baru dengan role "staff" -- 200
# @name loginUserBaru
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "userbiasa",
  "password": "Rahasia123!"
}

@tokenUserBaru = {{loginUserBaru.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/students/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserBaru}}


@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Register - Success
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "sari",
  "email": "sari@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 2. Register - Weak Password Rejected
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "budi",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "password1"
}

### 4. Access Protected Endpoint Without Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### 5a. Login - Incorrect Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "sari",
  "password": "salahsekali9"
}

### 5b. Login - Non-existent User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "tidakada",
  "password": "salahsekali9"
}

### 6. Login - Success (Captures Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "sari",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### Store tokens from response (VS Code REST Client syntax)
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refresh_token}}

### 7a. Get Current Profile (Using Access Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7b. Get Users List (Using Access Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Access with Tampered / Invalid Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}X

### 9a. Refresh Token - Valid Call
# @name refreshTokenCall
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 9b. Reuse Old Refresh Token (Token Reuse Detection)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 10. Brute Force Attempt (Simulate Consecutive Failed Logins)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "sari",
  "password": "salahsekali9"
}